<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PairGain Technologies.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PairGain Technologies.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson Stephens said analyst Paul Johnson raised estimates on PairGain Technologies Inc for fiscal 1996 to $0.90 from $0.84 and to $1.18 from $1.05 for fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>-- Johnson also reiterates a buy recommendation on the company due to &quot;excellent&quot; third-quarter results.  &quot;The company remains one of our favorite stock in the industry,&quot; Johnson said in a report.</p>
</text>
